{"t":"XOM","made":"2026-11-14 00:19","name":"ExxonMobil Holdings Corporation","ko":"엑슨모빌","sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas Integrated","employees":57900,"hq":"Spring, TX, United States","website":"https://corporate.exxonmobil.com","summary_en":"ExxonMobil Holdings Corporation engages in the exploration and production of crude oil and natural gas in the United States, Canada, and internationally. The company operates through Upstream, Energy Products, Chemical Products, and Specialty Products segments. Its Upstream segment explores for and produces crude oil and natural gas. The Energy Products segment offers fuels, aromatics, and catalysts, as well as licensing services. Its Chemical Products segment manufactures and sells olefins, polyolefins, and intermediates. The Specialty Products segment offers finished lubricants, basestocks, waxes, synthetics, elastomers, and resins. It is also involved in the manufacture, trade, transport, and sale of crude oil, natural gas, petroleum products, petrochemicals, and other specialty products; and pursuit of lower-emission and business opportunities, including carbon capture and storage, hydrogen, lower-emission fuels, Proxxima resin systems, carbon materials, low-carbon data center, and lithium. In addition, the company offers aviation fuel. It sells its products under the Exxon, Esso, and Mobil brands. The company was formerly known as Exxon Mobil Corporation and changed its name to ExxonMobil Holdings Corporation in July 2026. ExxonMobil Holdings Corporation was founded in 1870 and is headquartered in Spring, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"ExxonMobil Holdings Corporation은 미국, 캐나다 및 국제적으로 원유와 천연가스의 탐사 및 생산에 종사하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 업스트림, 에너지 제품, 화학 제품 및 특수 제품 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 업스트림 부문에서는 원유와 천연가스를 탐색하고 생산합니다. 에너지 제품 부문은 연료, 방향족 화합물, 촉매제와 라이센스 서비스를 제공합니다. 화학 제품 부문은 올레핀, 폴리올레핀 및 중간체를 제조 및 판매합니다. 특수 제품 부문에서는 완제품 윤활유, 기유, 왁스, 합성 물질, 엘라스토머 및 수지를 제공합니다. 또한 원유, 천연가스, 석유 제품, 석유화학 제품 및 기타 특수 제품의 제조, 무역, 운송 및 판매에도 참여합니다. 탄소 포집 및 저장, 수소, 저배출 연료, Proxxima 수지 시스템, 탄소 재료, 저탄소 데이터 센터 및 리튬을 포함한 저배출 및 비즈니스 기회 추구. 또한 회사는 항공 연료를 제공합니다. Exxon, Esso 및 Mobil 브랜드로 제품을 판매합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Exxon Mobil Corporation으로 알려졌으며 2026년 7월에 ExxonMobil Holdings Corporation으로 이름을 변경했습니다. ExxonMobil Holdings Corporation은 1870년에 설립되었으며 텍사스주 스프링에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":170.1758,"mcap":694184968192.0,"pe":17.507797,"fpe":13.55776,"peg":1.3128,"ps":1.7880675,"pb":2.611781,"ev_ebitda":9.253,"div":2.52,"beta":0.141,"hi52":188.5,"lo52":114.19},"fin":{"rev":388231987200.0,"rev_g":0.326,"eps_g":1.114,"gross":0.29808,"op":0.12875,"net":0.10463,"roe":0.15528,"fcf":28318750720.0,"cash":12152999936.0,"debt":34250000384.0,"de":12.568,"eps":9.72,"feps":12.55191},"own":{"short":0.0125,"inst":0.69021004,"insider":0.0008},"analyst":{"n":22,"mean":184.31818,"median":185.5,"high":213.0,"low":160.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.42308,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":6,"hold":17,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":6,"hold":17,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":7,"hold":15,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":7,"hold":15,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-12","Firm":"Bernstein","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":186.0,"priorPriceTarget":193.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-07","Firm":"Freedom Broker","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"Hold","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":162.0,"priorPriceTarget":142.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":175.0,"priorPriceTarget":155.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"TD Cowen","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":193.0,"priorPriceTarget":180.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"UBS"